,"colorHex":"#9B59B6","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[射命丸文] 「聞きたいことですか、、今は特にないですよ。このスクープ記事を載せて、彼をお持ち帰りできれば、満足ですから、」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":105,"pan":-0.2,"speed":105,"startTime":307.7542403628118,"duration":5.976371882086168,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_赤面.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/ソ'ーデ_スカ、デ'ワ、シバ'ラクノ\/アイダ、ヘヤノ\/ソ'トデ\/マ'ッテ+イテモラッテ'モ\/ダイジョ'ーブデ_スカ？","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":53,"text":"「そうですか…、では、しばらくの間、\n部屋の外で待っていてもらっても大丈夫ですか？」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.8616943,0.92227477,0.973294,0.8628051,1,0.28862,0.9963043,0.82713926,1,1,0.4465576,1,0.7260132,0.84316707,0.75743407,0.7898865,0.699472,0.88728327,0.95333856,0.9894012,0.7848877,0.791394,1],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__8B10","id":"B1EA4F15-FD56-406D-B353-5922BC06F267","character":"赤面","colorHex":"#E74C3C","voiceType":"女声1 (標準)","name":"[赤面] 「そうですか…、では、しばらくの間、\n部屋の外で待っていてもらっても大丈夫ですか？」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":125,"pan":-0.2,"speed":120,"startTime":314.33061224489796,"duration":5.827868480725623,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_射命丸文.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/ワカリマ'_シタ。デ'ワ、オワッタ'ラ\/イッテクダサ'イ。ワタシワ\/ソ'ー\/イウト、ソノ\/ヘヤ'カラ\/デ'タ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":54,"text":"「分かりました。では、終わったら言ってください。」私はそういうと、その部屋から出た。","waveformPoints":[0.6160797,1,0.5994171,1,0.12,0.7904419,1,0.7453735,1,0.9682953,0.6280609,0.95861506,1,0.12,1,1,1,0.76231384,0.9739288,0.5416931,0.68574524,0.97123104,0.906961,1],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__BCF2","id":"705402E3-7A1F-4CE4-8782-1F2CEA508C1B","character":"射命丸文","colorHex":"#9B59B6","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[射命丸文] 「分かりました。では、終わったら言ってください。」私はそういうと、その部屋から出た。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":105,"pan":-0.2,"speed":105,"startTime":320.7584807256236,"duration":7.9609977324263035,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_赤面.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/サ'テト、サッソ_ク\/カ'レノ\/ケ'ンサオ\/ハジメマショ'ーカ、ワタシワ\/ソ'ー\/イウト、カ'レニ\/ア'ル+モノ'オ\/トリツ'ケテ、ケ'ンサオ\/ハジメタ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":55,"text":"「さてと、早速彼の”検査”を始めましょうか…」\n私はそういうと、彼にあるものを取り付けて、検査を始めた。","waveformPoints":[1,1,1,0.9368347,1,0.9098968,1,0.9429443,0.8305511,0.91045225,1,1,1,1,1,1,0.9632965,1,0.8691925,0.8232513,0.99170226,1,0.88299865,1],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__8B10","id":"F64C4FE8-A0AF-4F04-A7A2-9C54E65EFAB6","character":"赤面","colorHex":"#E74C3C","voiceType":"女声1 (標準)","name":"[赤面] 「さてと、早速彼の”検査”を始めましょうか…」\n私はそういうと、彼にあるものを取り付けて、検査を始めた。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":332.3194784580499,"duration":5.851995464852608,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、+ン'ッ、アレ、ココワ、ボ'クワ、マ'ブタオ\/コスリナ'ガラ、_フト\/カラダオ\/オコ'_ス。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":57,"text":"「んっ、あれ、、ここは、」僕は、瞼を擦りながら、ふと体を起こす。","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.31976318,0.12,0.80833435,0.6491272,0.18229675,0.7326782,1,0.12,0.78726804,1,0.12,0.6528168,1,0.79996336,0.5500244,0.82654417,0.7685028,0.12,0.84713435,0.78841853,1,0.7222839,0.13703002],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"DBA3668A-A2C5-4BCB-B874-AC7A342416C2","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] 「んっ、あれ、、ここは、」僕は、瞼を擦りながら、ふと体を起こす。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":125,"pan":-0.2,"speed":120,"startTime":338.7714739229025,"duration":2.665986394557823,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_射命丸文.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、+オ'ヤ、メ'ガ\/サ'メタンデスネ、ソームサン。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":58,"text":"「おや、目が覚めたんですね、操夢さん。」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.56105345,0.82610774,0.97214353,0.5856506,