","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":140,"pan":0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1231.0114058956913,"duration":3.3519954648526076,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_195_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"。\/スゴ'イ、ワタシノ\/コ'ノミオ\/ハア_クシテル'ノ？","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":195,"text":"「。すごい、私の好みを把握してるの？」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.12,0.12,0.19288939,0.4826599,0.7407715,0.5254669,0.12,0.69594115,1,0.8783569,0.6908233,0.45445248,0.7852844,0.49416503,0.6831665,0.85209346,0.91144407,0.27525023,0.588388,0.66376644,0.780603,0.47746274,0.4949585],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__0E66","id":"3E2ECFF2-D342-4BBA-977D-33A94C9FB1AD","character":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","colorHex":"#F1C40F","voiceType":"中性","name":"[パチュリー・ノーレッジ] 「。すごい、私の好みを把握してるの？」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1234.963401360544,"duration":7.444489795918368,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_196_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、+イ'ヤ、ボ'クガ\/アタマ'デ\/ヨソ_クシタ'ンデスヨ。ボ'クワ\/ソ'ー\/カ'エ_ス。スルト、カ'ノジョガ\/ハンノースル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":196,"text":"「いや、僕が頭で予測したんですよ。」僕はそう返す。すると、彼女が反応する。","waveformPoints":[0.41045532,0.8371368,0.8305511,0.92338556,0.9244964,0.6778503,0.6297668,0.9846405,0.6465881,0.6506744,0.12,0.81972045,1,0.8263061,0.78941035,0.12,0.21300353,0.7459686,0.95266414,0.75084835,0.8460632,0.8645111,0.4810333,0.73049617],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"47E21BCA-A386-495D-9745-6E5AA0ECFDD9","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] 「いや、僕が頭で予測したんですよ。」僕はそう返す。すると、彼女が反応する。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":140,"pan":0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1243.0078911564624,"duration":1.5,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_197_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、+ア'、キモチイ'イ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":197,"text":"「あ、気持ちいい。」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.12,0.12,0.12,0.8500305,0.8219818,0.8683197,0.17904358,0.12,0.12,0.12,0.28342283,0.45512694,0.43731382,0.384906,0.4502075,0.23276061,0.5568878,0.705899,0.4825012,0.35546875,0.3581665,0.346344,0.13905334],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__0E66","id":"88F074A1-8919-4A26-8CF5-3B19BC8BB12D","character":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","colorHex":"#F1C40F","voiceType":"中性","name":"[パチュリー・ノーレッジ] 「あ、気持ちいい。」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1245.1078911564623,"duration":7.199478458049887,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_198_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ボ'クワ、イッシュン\/ニコ'ット\/ホホエ'ミ、ソノママ'\/カ'ノジョオ\/ウゴカ'_ス。コ'ンドワ、_スコ'シダケ\/ハヤ'_ク+スル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":198,"text":"僕は、一瞬ニコッと微笑み、そのまま彼女を動かす。今度は、少しだけ早くする。","waveformPoints":[0.81805414,1,0.37213135,0.65908504,0.7476349,0.7968292,0.9276306,0.5742645,0.12,0.55458677,0.62825924,0.75802916,0.74438167,0.9516327,0.13175353,0.12,0.72061765,1,0.703836,0.7905609,0.8359863,0.9137451,0.94619745,0.7587036],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"9FAEF3C3-A75D-450B-8092-AAF5E1CCD93C","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] 僕は、一瞬ニコッと微笑み、そのまま彼女を動かす。今度は、少しだけ早くする。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1252.9073696145122,"duration":3.294489795918367,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_199_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"スルト、ス'グニ\/カ'ノジョノ\/ハンノーガ\/カ'エッテ+ク'ル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":199,"text":"すると、すぐに彼女の反応が返ってくる。","waveformPoints":[0.52772826,0.7460083,0.6469848,0.9529022,0.12,0.12,0.49860838,0.47555846,0.42108762,0.7810394,0.4676239,0.6648376,0.50241697,0.8123413,0.79881287,0.44441527,0.64067