":"中性","name":"[操夢] 僕は、もう一回、ニコッと微笑み、彼女を動かす。そして、最初の時よりも遅い速度にする。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1269.5720861678,"duration":5.939478458049886,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_202_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ソ_シテ、カ'ノジョノ\/ハンノーガ\/カ'エッテ+ク'ルト、ボ'クワ、ソット\/カ'ノジョノ\/_クチオ\/フージル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":202,"text":"そして、彼女の反応が返ってくると、僕は、そっと彼女の口を封じる。","waveformPoints":[0.5642273,0.6077881,0.2055847,0.7950836,0.6058441,0.8231323,0.61219174,0.79936826,0.82713926,0.592276,0.618222,0.9066436,0.12,0.78726804,1,0.12,0.6238159,0.9316375,0.87903136,0.6355194,0.6772552,0.93600154,0.44921568,0.6957824],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"9D9A03AE-D238-4DCB-85AF-2B701318E362","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] そして、彼女の反応が返ってくると、僕は、そっと彼女の口を封じる。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1276.11156462585,"duration":4.715238095238095,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_203_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ソ_シテ、ネオ_チシ'タ\/カ'ノジョオ\/ソノママ',ソット\/ベ'ッドカラ\/ユカニ\/ウツ'_ス。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":203,"text":"そして、寝落ちした彼女をそのままそっとベッドから床に移す。","waveformPoints":[0.5642273,0.55506283,0.6077881,0.22514342,0.8893463,0.3257141,0.8034149,0.90950006,0.4421539,0.6935211,0.6309967,0.4446533,0.43763122,0.4483032,0.6638458,0.93731076,0.63686824,0.7959564,0.7760803,0.6201263,0.8105957,0.42985532,0.5759704,0.14674987],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"014666D6-7131-4B77-B311-0A4A1A6C6664","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] そして、寝落ちした彼女をそのままそっとベッドから床に移す。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1281.426802721088,"duration":5.106984126984127,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/L