e__B740","id":"6D048807-1754-499F-A209-0DEA23C6A22A","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] 「レミリアさんたちは、。」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":100,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1365.8514965986394,"duration":6.1544897959183675,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_219_博麗霊夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/カ'ノジョタチナラ、ア'ンタノ+コト'オ\/ワタ_シタ'チニ\/ツゲテ'カラ、コーマ'カンニ\/モド'ッテ+イッタ'ワ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":219,"text":"「彼女たちなら、あんたのことを私たちに告げてから、紅魔館に戻っていったわ、。」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.88688654,0.7852844,1,0.8244018,0.5265381,1,1,0.9102539,1,0.9509979,0.936914,0.80885005,0.86046445,1,0.8565765,0.18162231,0.92402035,1,0.6982025,0.9871399,0.67459714,1,1],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice_reimu","id":"6CC3F312-447E-45B0-932F-994B23ABE808","character":"博麗霊夢","colorHex":"#E74C3C","voiceType":"女声1 (標準)","name":"[博麗霊夢] 「彼女たちなら、あんたのことを私たちに告げてから、紅魔館に戻っていったわ、。」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":100,"pan":0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1372.6059863945577,"duration":4.944489795918368,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_220_霧雨魔理沙.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/ソ'ロソロ、ア'レガ\/シダレソ'ーダゼ、ハヤ'ク\/オマエノ\/ベ'ッドニ\/イカナ'イカ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":220,"text":"「そろそろ、アレが垂れそうだぜ、、早くお前のベッドに行かないか、。」","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.737677,0.8969238,0.8464599,0.7665191,1,0.9139038,0.7155792,0.92120355,0.7808807,1,0.5574829,0.51967466,1,0.99400324,1,0.76199645,0.7973449,0.9018829,0.9761108,0.5232055,0.80742186,0.5368133,0.8195221],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice_marisa","id":"68ABCBED-3687-423D-BBD5-FC3303A3A9C0","character":"霧雨魔理沙","colorHex":"#F1C40F","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[霧雨魔理沙] 「そろそろ、アレが垂れそうだぜ、、早くお前のベッドに行かないか、。」","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1378.1504761904762,"duration":5.739478458049