す。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":181,"pan":-0.2,"speed":75,"startTime":1593.6781179138327,"duration":6.65687074829932,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_253_古明地こいし.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、+ジャ'ー、ハジメル'カラネ。ワタシワ\/ソ'ー+イイ、カ'レオ\/セメハジメ'ル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":253,"text":"「じゃあ、始めるからね。」私はそう言い、彼を攻め始める。","waveformPoints":[0.12,0.7792938,0.8757385,0.12,0.9381042,0.7005035,0.6679718,1,0.45334166,0.12,0.12,1,1,1,0.7982574,0.7167297,0.457666,0.6417877,1,1,0.48801574,0.9704773,0.51868284,0.7513641],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__6F5C","id":"96543C6A-FC90-44DD-AE1D-299FF508D4A1","character":"古明地こいし","colorHex":"#3498DB","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[古明地こいし] 「じゃあ、始めるからね。」私はそう言い、彼を攻め始める。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":115,"pan":-0.2,"speed":100,"startTime":1600.934988662132,"duration":5.056984126984127,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_254_操夢.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ボ'クワ、カ'ノジョノ\/ビンカンナ+トコロ'オ\/サグリ、ミ_ツケルト、ソコオ+ツ'_ク。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":254,"text":"僕は、彼女の敏感なところを探り、見つけると、そこをつく。","waveformPoints":[0.81805414,0.9556396,1,0.70760494,0.79468685,0.6058441,0.5151123,0.84899896,0.7218872,0.7176025,0.7905609,0.85979,0.83761287,0.4730194,0.12,0.4266815,0.6256012,0.77247006,0.9121582,0.12,0.6465881,0.748587,0.63079834,0.28996885],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__B740","id":"E82CD28F-6D68-48F8-B7B1-23BC30E783BC","character":"操夢","colorHex":"#1ABC9C","voiceType":"中性","name":"[操夢] 僕は、彼女の敏感なところを探り、見つけると、そこをつく。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":181,"pan":-0.2,"speed":75,"startTime":1606.591972789116,"duration":7.735736961451247,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_255_古明地こいし.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ワタシワ、カ'レガ\/ワタシノ\/キューショオ\/キューニ+ツ_キ、オドロ'_クト\/ドージニ、ア'レガ\/デ'テ+ク'ル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":255,"text":"私は、彼が私の急所を急に突き、驚くと同時に、アレが出てくる。","waveformPoints":[1,0.7709625,1,0.6405182,1,1,1,0.6716217,0.6282196,0.8157928,0.6194916,0.78853756,0.26993406,0.45968932,0.930011,0.86752623,0.88383174,0.69038695,0.5441925,0.8901794,0.92707515,0.8935913,0.69744873,0.70581967],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__6F5C","id":"A167FBB7-F886-43B4-9E84-8D5E5F9C77B5","character":"古明地こいし","colorHex":"#3498DB","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[古明地こいし] 私は、彼が私の急所を急に突き、驚くと同時に、アレが出てくる。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":181,"pan":-0.2,"speed":75,"startTime":1614.9277097505671,"duration":7.518231292517007,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_256_古明地こいし.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"、\/マ'ダ\/ツズケルヨ。ワタシワ、ナ'ニカニ\/ヒ'ガ\/ツ'イタ+ヨ'ーニ\/カ'レオ\/セメツズケ'ル。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":256,"text":"「まだ続けるよ。」私は、何かに火がついたように彼を攻め続ける。","waveformPoints":[0.12,1,0.8151184,0.8565765,0.8119049,0.7024872,0.12,0.90616757,1,1,1,0.6398437,0.6818176,0.97777706,0.72462463,0.8103973,0.986029,0.79032284,0.8424133,1,0.7565216,0.79190975,0.7373596,0.7831024],"playbackRate":1,"isLooping":false,"trackId":"track_voice__6F5C","id":"866DF7D6-D051-467C-B462-0771E8E29843","character":"古明地こいし","colorHex":"#3498DB","voiceType":"女声2 (高め)","name":"[古明地こいし] 「まだ続けるよ。」私は、何かに火がついたように彼を攻め続ける。","type":"Voice","fadeOutDuration":0},{"pitch":181,"pan":-0.2,"speed":75,"startTime":1623.0459410430842,"duration":8.390249433106575,"audioFilePath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_257_古明地こいし.wav","isReversed":false,"voiceSymbol":"ダ'ガ、オナジ\/ケッカオ\/タド'ルダケニ\/ナ'ッテ+シマイ、オモワ'ズ、ウウー。ト\/ナゲ'イテ+シマウ。","volume":1,"fadeInDuration":0,"sceneIndex":257,"text":"だが、同じ結果を辿るだけになってしまい、思わず、「うぅー。」と嘆いてしまう。","waveformPoints":[1,0.9393341,0.7803253,0.63996273,0.8269409,1,1,1,0.7902038,0.51562804,0.7114532,0.54371643,0.32813415,0.7441833,1,0.518087